### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Login as demo user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@film-tinder.local",
  "password": "User12345!"
}

### Paginated catalog
GET http://localhost:3000/api/movies?page=1&limit=5

### GraphQL catalog
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { movies(page: 1, limit: 5) { data { id title rating genres { name } credits { name role } } meta { total totalPages } } }"
}
